@startuml
' Order lifecycle as a state machine: choice, self-loop and final states.
title Order states
[*] --> Draft
state "Awaiting payment" as Waiting #LightBlue
Draft -> Waiting : submit
Waiting --> Paid : pay
Waiting -down-> Cancelled : timeout
Paid --> Paid : add note
state check <<choice>>
Paid --> check : ship
check --> Shipped : in stock
check --> Backorder : missing
Backorder --> Shipped : restocked
Shipped --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
state Paid : money received
skinparam backgroundColor white
@enduml
